+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/merge-undo — the steward who made the last merge into the person undoes
+# it, on the same sheet-today it was made: the merged person is back at the end of the list (their id, grades, terms,
+# contact and tags as before) with the claims that came from them (their numbers and status as they are now) and their
+# own aliases, which leave the person's; patron and pool changes stay. Records PERSON_MERGE_UNDONE, then the ROLLUP and
+# TOTALS lines. 422, storing nothing, for anyone else, any later day, or a person with no merge to undo; 404 for a
+# person not on the sheet. Responds with the person restored.
